[00:01.12]1. Our Sov’reign Lord Jehovah
[00:06.44]Is zealous for his holy name.
[00:14.22]He fervently desires
[00:19.24]To clear it from unrighteous blame.
[00:26.78]Through many generations,
[00:31.66]Great endurance he has shown;
[00:36.50]In loving, kindly patience,
[00:42.08]Not weary has he grown.
[00:50.06]His will is that salvation
[00:54.26]All sorts of people might attain.
[01:00.28]Long-lasting, loving patience
[01:07.70]By God will not have been in vain.
[01:15.52]2. The quality of patience
[01:26.06]Will help us on our godly path.
[01:31.12]It lets our heart be tranquil,
[01:35.86]Protects us from unrighteous wrath.
[01:40.58]It finds the good in others,
[01:46.54]Always hoping for the best.
[01:51.70]It helps us keep our balance
[01:56.00]In times when we’re distressed.
[02:05.38]Along with other virtues
[02:09.60]That holy spirit can bestow,
[02:14.32]Our patience will assist us
[02:22.28]To imitate the God we know.
